sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sch as Rotation scheduler
    participant Ct as Rotation controller
    participant V as Secret store
    participant DB as Backing system
    participant Ag as Node agent
    participant App as Application
    Sch->>Ct: secret is due for rotation
    Ct->>DB: create the new credential
    Note over Ct,DB: both old and new are valid during the overlap
    Ct->>V: write new version, keep the old one
    V->>Ag: notify subscribers
    Ag->>App: deliver new version
    App->>App: reload without restarting
    Ct->>Ct: wait for every consumer to report the new version
    alt all consumers moved
        Ct->>DB: revoke the old credential
    else someone is still on the old one
        Ct->>Sch: hold the overlap open, alert the owner
    end
